{
  "question_type": "single_choice",
  "stem_md": "方程 $y^3\\frac{d^3y}{dx^3}-1=0$ 的通解是（ ）",
  "options_json": [
    {
      "key": "opt_1",
      "content_md": "$C_1y^3+1=(C_1x-C_2)^2$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_2",
      "content_md": "$(C_1y+1)^3=C_1x+C_2$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_3",
      "content_md": "$C_1y^2-1=(C_1x-C_2)^3$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_4",
      "content_md": "$C_1y^2-1=(C_1x+C_2)^2$"
    }
  ],
  "answer_json": {
    "option_keys": [
      "opt_4"
    ]
  },
  "analysis_md": "解答 令 $p=y'$，$y''=p\\frac{dp}{dy}$，原方程化为 $y^3p\\frac{dp}{dy}-1=0$，即 $p\\,dp=y^{-3}\\,dy$，积分得 $\\frac{p^2}{2}=-\\frac{1}{2}y^{-2}+\\frac{C_1}{2}$，即\n\n$$p^2=-y^{-2}+C_1,$$ 故 $y'=\\pm\\sqrt{C_1-y^{-2}}$，即 $\\pm\\frac{dy}{\\sqrt{C_1-y^{-2}}}=dx$，从而\n\n$$\\pm\\frac{1}{2C_1}\\int\\frac{d(C_1y^2-1)}{(C_1y^2-1)^{\\frac{1}{2}}}=\\int dx,$$ 即 $\\pm2\\sqrt{C_1y^2-1}=2C_1x+C_2$，则原方程的解为 $C_1y^2-1=(C_1x+C_2)^2$。",
  "search_text": "方程 $y^3\\frac{d^3y}{dx^3}-1=0$ 的通解是（ ） $C_1y^3+1=(C_1x-C_2)^2$ $(C_1y+1)^3=C_1x+C_2$ $C_1y^2-1=(C_1x-C_2)^3$ $C_1y^2-1=(C_1x+C_2)^2$ 解答 令 $p=y'$，$y''=p\\frac{dp}{dy}$，原方程化为 $y^3p\\frac{dp}{dy}-1=0$，即 $p\\,dp=y^{-3}\\,dy$，积分得 $\\frac{p^2}{2}=-\\frac{1}{2}y^{-2}+\\frac{C_1}{2}$，即\n\n$$p^2=-y^{-2}+C_1,$$ 故 $y'=\\pm\\sqrt{C_1-y^{-2}}$，即 $\\pm\\frac{dy}{\\sqrt{C_1-y^{-2}}}=dx$，从而\n\n$$\\pm\\frac{1}{2C_1}\\int\\frac{d(C_1y^2-1)}{(C_1y^2-1)^{\\frac{1}{2}}}=\\int dx,$$ 即 $\\pm2\\sqrt{C_1y^2-1}=2C_1x+C_2$，则原方程的解为 $C_1y^2-1=(C_1x+C_2)^2$。",
  "sort_order": 10
}
